@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Dashboard"; }
<h1>Dashboard</h1>
<p><code>HomeController.Index</code> returns <code>View()</code> and nothing else. The "Recent activity" panel on the right is a
<strong>view component</strong>. It is invoked from the layout, resolves <code>IRecentActivityFeedService</code> itself and renders on every page.</p>
<h2>Try the custom ISO date binder</h2>
<ul>
    <li><a href="/activity?from=@DateTime.UtcNow.AddDays(-3).ToString("yyyy-MM-dd")&to=@DateTime.UtcNow.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd")">Valid range: last 3 days</a></li>
    <li><a href="/activity?from=11/05/2026">Rejected: culture-specific format <code>11/05/2026</code></a></li>
    <li><a href="/activity?from=2026-11-31">Rejected: impossible date <code>2026-11-31</code></a></li>
    <li><a href="/activity/day/@DateTime.UtcNow.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd")">Route-bound: today's summary</a></li>
</ul>
